# PKAgent LLM API key configuration.
#
# Provide exactly ONE of the keys below. PKAgent picks a backend in this
# priority order: OpenRouter > Anthropic > Gemini direct > deterministic
# (rule-based fallback when no key is set).
#
# OpenRouter (recommended; routes to google/gemini-3-flash-preview by default).
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini direct (free tier: 20 req/day/model).
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic Claude (claude-sonnet-4-6 via the official SDK).
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
